@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+Fix ``RecursionError`` when a TOML ``set_env`` value uses substitutions that trigger environment creation (such as
+``{env_site_packages_dir}``). The TOML loader now defers ``set_env`` string substitutions like the INI loader does.
